{
  "id": "click-test",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Tıklama oranı reklama bağlı mı?",
    "en": "Does the click rate depend on the ad?"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Sonuç nesnesinde `statistic`, `pvalue`, `dof`, `expected_freq` var.",
      "en": "The result object has `statistic`, `pvalue`, `dof`, `expected_freq`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`round(float(res.statistic), 2)`, `int(res.dof)`, `bool(res.pvalue < 0.05)`, `res.expected_freq.round(1).tolist()`.",
      "en": "`round(float(res.statistic), 2)`, `int(res.dof)`, `bool(res.pvalue < 0.05)`, `res.expected_freq.round(1).tolist()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef click_test(table):\n    res = stats.chi2_contingency(np.array(table))\n    return {\"stat\": round(float(res.statistic), 2), \"dof\": int(res.dof),\n            \"significant\": bool(res.pvalue < 0.05),\n            \"expected\": res.expected_freq.round(1).tolist()}\n\nresult = click_test([[90, 60], [45, 105]])\nprint(result[\"stat\"], result[\"dof\"], result[\"significant\"])\nprint(result[\"expected\"])\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef click_test(table):\n    res = stats.chi2_contingency(np.array(table))\n    return {\"stat\": round(float(res.statistic), 2), \"dof\": int(res.dof),\n            \"significant\": bool(res.pvalue < 0.05),\n            \"expected\": res.expected_freq.round(1).tolist()}\n\nresult = click_test([[90, 60], [45, 105]])\nprint(result[\"stat\"], result[\"dof\"], result[\"significant\"])\nprint(result[\"expected\"])\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "click_test",
      "cases": [
